Notes: Hand 21/30. 4 active players. S5 continues to dominate with 587 chips. S1 is leaning solid but pot-controlled. S4 medium. S2, S3 eliminated.
Strategy adjustment: Tighten further in early positions, be more aggressive with strong hands on dry boards. On flush-heavy boards, always consider if my pair holds up. Being near 100 chips means I can't afford fights with created pairs and flushes/sets. Next hand: BTN=S0(me), SB=S4, BB=S5."}
